  "rules": [
    "GetRarityTextureOffset false for MISSIONS or default rarity (including FREE); hides both gem and frame.",
    "Card entity runtime rarity/cardset must come from same modern visual metadata, not 2014 gameplay tags.",
    "Frame prefab minion is separate Warlock material; Actor.SetMaterialWithTexture only updates body/front + SPELL portraitFrame + legacy + LOCATION noGem, NOT rarityFrame explicitly. Keep direct original material unless shared material-instance binding proves runtime replacement. Spell rarity frame references same material asset as spell body; exact clone-sharing policy unresolved.",
    "Gem main ST offset changed at runtime; scrolling UV remains original UV*Scale + Unity_Time.x*Speed, does not use main offset.",
    "Source texture wrap0=Repeat filter2=Trilinear mipbias=-.5. Existing compatibility samplers may differ; explicit evidence retained, do not silently claim identical sampling."
  ]
}